                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3dfef576-d476-3878-af23-46184708532f",
                        "entry_id": "91c0eab4-7c8d-336d-9316-f0cb0c750313",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An instrument for measuring distance travelled, such as an odometer, pedometer, perambulator, etc."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "46b632ff-0299-4d26-9b83-2879f3abc22f",
                                "sense_id": "3dfef576-d476-3878-af23-46184708532f",
                                "text": "I went to see Colonel Blount, who showed me the application of the \"Waywiser\" to a coach, exactly measuring the miles and showing them by an index as we went along."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e5d4a905-632c-4ac1-b5b7-f298a1fe2ba2",
                                "sense_id": "3dfef576-d476-3878-af23-46184708532f",
                                "text": "The Emperor Rudolphus II had a curious waywiser or odometer which is attributed to Schissler."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "385f7e7c-aeca-4f29-bd50-50c991179b93",
                                "sense_id": "3dfef576-d476-3878-af23-46184708532f",
                                "text": "Therefore, Elector Augustus did all he could to promote the development of mechanical waywisers that would be able to do this work automatically."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7f7f59de-5380-3bf3-a38b-97841f26b344",
                        "entry_id": "91c0eab4-7c8d-336d-9316-f0cb0c750313",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An instrument for determining direction (and possibly other aspects of one's travel as well)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f0a52117-399e-44d6-9749-5e6d3b633d19",
                                "sense_id": "7f7f59de-5380-3bf3-a38b-97841f26b344",
                                "text": "Not being accustomed to this cruciform movement, I was not able, by the waywiser, to determine the real direction of the balloon, and on this account M. Robertson suffered to escape a considerable quantity of gas; on which we again fell till the barometer stood at 29 inches, about 50 minutes past seven."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4bd8d2ea-d199-4425-afeb-0957b97ac2ce",
                                "sense_id": "7f7f59de-5380-3bf3-a38b-97841f26b344",
                                "text": "THE Waywiser is an instrument whereby a man may steer himself where there is no path, or underground, in a mine; or find his way if he have lost it."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "da9c684e-44fc-4bb7-844a-762fdf06a8ab",
                                "sense_id": "7f7f59de-5380-3bf3-a38b-97841f26b344",
                                "text": "The purpose of the waywiser was to enable a navigator to keep a track of a ship's location by measuring and recording the speed and direction of its journey."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6aa1927b-7f79-3317-b5d8-67254907c867",
                        "entry_id": "91c0eab4-7c8d-336d-9316-f0cb0c750313",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A guide; A means of determining the direction in which to proceed."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7fe12f18-158e-4340-ad91-98b83e6a7536",
                                "sense_id": "6aa1927b-7f79-3317-b5d8-67254907c867",
                                "text": "We have not sought to make a treatise, but only to set up a waywiser or signpost to show the road the law is taking ."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "88c9a007-ebc6-4745-aacd-f3f9eac8bb86",
                                "sense_id": "6aa1927b-7f79-3317-b5d8-67254907c867",
                                "text": "In previous volumes we have often given a few words of help to the prospective reader, intended as a sort of waywiser to guide him through those pages not always possible to lighten by some memorable illustration ."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8e84b5fe-d10e-493f-a4f7-c025083c2861",
                                "sense_id": "6aa1927b-7f79-3317-b5d8-67254907c867",
                                "text": "This is the research question. This is the waywiser."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
